~ start
Danny: I'm mid-raid, so I'm saying this ONCE. Arrows move, Q punches, W dashes. Land three punches in rhythm and the third one really hurts.
Danny: HOLD SHIFT to block whatever's coming at your face. It drains that stamina bar under your hearts, and if that bar empties you're standing there wide open. Which, honestly, tracks.
Danny: TAP SHIFT the instant a hit lands and you PARRY it. Costs no stamina, staggers some attacks, and then you get to hit them back. Dashing costs a little stamina and leaves you stuck for a moment after, unless you parry out of it.
Danny: Boss goes all dizzy on you? Mash Q and W to wind up an uppercut. That's everything, dum dum. Click I'm ready and go meet Eric, the White Knight. Don't cry to me when he flattens you.
=> END
